[2.012, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m### Admission REJECTS the original insecure Deployment (PSS + Kyverno) ###\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.244, "o", "Warning: would violate PodSecurity \"restricted:latest\": allowPrivilegeEscalation != false (container \"ledger-api-insecure\" must set securityContext.allowPrivilegeEscalation=false), unrestricted capabilities (container \"ledger-api-insecure\" must set securityContext.capabilities.drop=[\"ALL\"]), runAsNonRoot != true (pod or container \"ledger-api-insecure\" must set securityContext.runAsNonRoot=true), seccompProfile (pod or container \"ledger-api-insecure\" must set securityContext.seccompProfile.type to \"RuntimeDefault\" or \"Localhost\")\r\nError from server: error when creating \"STDIN\": admission webhook \"validate.kyverno.svc-fail\" denied the request: \r\nresource Deployment/payments/ledger-api-insecure was blocked due to the following policies \r\ndisallow-run-as-root:\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1;32m=> insecure workload blocked before scheduling\u001b[0m\r\n"]
